  "title": "Reader test: images",
  "URL": "https://jetpack.wpmt.co/reader-test-images/",
  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Images in every form the cleanup and Photon treat differently. The featured image is the first one.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"The featured image, also in the post\" class=\"wp-image-143\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=300%2C163&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=1024%2C555&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-49.jpg?resize=768%2C416&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\"><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The featured image, also in the post</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">HEIC, converted to JPEG when it was uploaded:</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-heic.jpg?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"A HEIC upload\" class=\"wp-image-158\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-heic.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-heic.jpg?resize=300%2C163&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-heic.jpg?resize=1024%2C555&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-heic.jpg?resize=768%2C416&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The original HEIC file, which Android’s web view can’t show:</p>\n\n\n\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-heic.heic?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"The original HEIC\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">AVIF, which the site can’t make smaller sizes of:</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\" src=\"https://jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-avif.avif\" alt=\"An AVIF image\" class=\"wp-image-159\" srcset=\"https://jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-avif.avif 1200w, https://jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-avif.avif 300w, https://jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-avif.avif 1024w, https://jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-avif.avif 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">WebP:</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"550\" height=\"368\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-webp.webp?resize=550%2C368&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"A WebP image\" class=\"wp-image-160\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-webp.webp?w=550&amp;ssl=1 550w, https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-webp.webp?resize=300%2C201&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 550px) 100vw, 550px\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>An <code>http:</code> image:</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-45.png?resize=1200%2C650\" alt=\"Over http\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\"></p>\n<p>A protocol-relative image:</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-46.png?resize=1200%2C650\" alt=\"Protocol-relative\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\"></p>\n<p>A relative image, and a relative link to <a href=\"https://jetpack.wpmt.co/hello-world/\">another post</a>:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-47.png\" alt=\"Relative\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\"></p>\n<p>An image with no size and no <code>srcset</code>:</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-44.png?ssl=1\" alt=\"No size\"></p>\n<p>A <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> with a WebP source:</p>\n<picture><source srcset=\"https://jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reader-test-webp.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-43.png?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"A picture\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\"></picture>\n<p>A lazy-loading plugin’s image, with its real URL in <code>data-src</code>:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-42.png\" class=\"lazyload\" alt=\"Lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\"></p>\n<p>An image linked to another site:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/jetpack.wpmt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cmm2548-41.png?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"Linked\" width=\"1200\" height=\"650\"></a></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Emoji, which feeds turn into images: <img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f600.png\" alt=\"😀\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\"> <img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f389.png\" alt=\"🎉\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\"> <img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f44d-1f3fd.png\" alt=\"👍🏽\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\"> 1⃣ <img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f1e8-1f1e6.png\" alt=\"🇨🇦\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\">. A classic smiley: <img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f642.png\" alt=\"🙂\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\"> and <img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f609.png\" alt=\"😉\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The end.</p>",
  "excerpt": "Images in every form the cleanup and Photon treat differently. The featured image is the first one. HEIC, converted to JPEG when it was uploaded: The original HEIC file, which Android’s web view can’t show: AVIF, which the site can’t make smaller sizes of: WebP: An http: image: A protocol-relative image: A relative image, and&hellip;",
